                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Basically you're plopped down in the world that has a bunch of:  \"Hanging plot threads\", \"some platforming\", \"a bunch of investigation\", and \"puzzles\".  Where you then go about doing whatever you want, in what seems to be any order you want (as you discover it).\n\nIt's nice and relaxing to play.   Haven't ran into any enemies, and haven't ran into anything that forces a panic/rush.    Will probably want to keep your cellphone camera around, and a notepad since there are hints scattered all about the world and in conversation since investigation does matter.",
